transmed:TMO_0007 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "NCI Thesaurus";
                  <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "A prognosis is a hypothesis about the likely course of a disease, the chance of recovery or recurrence."@en;
