transmed:TMO_0031 <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> "NCI thesaurus";
                  <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "A diagnosis is a study composed of investigation, analysis and recognition of the presence and nature of disease, condition, or injury from expressed signs and symptoms; also, the scientific determination of any kind; the concise results of such an investigation."@en;
                  <http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> "Galen:Diagnosis",
                                                                           "ACGT:Diagnosis",
