                  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> transmed:TMO_0139,
                                                               transmed:TMO_0046.
transmed:TMO_0037 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "A gene is a part of DNA that encodes information about other molecular entities."@en;
