                  rdfs:subClassOf transmed:TMO_0101.
transmed:TMO_0103 <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/description> "An enumerated numerical quantity is a numerical quantity selected from a discrete set of quantities."@en;
                  a <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Class>;
